    <h1>What is this?</h1>
    <p>This is the about page. Different information about the project or its features will be provided here. If rules aren't listed properly or if any problems arise, please contact the dev, Connor Y. Suggestions for changes to the game or new ideas will also be considered.</p>
    <h1>What are the rules?</h1>
    <p>The OG one everyone is dealt 7 cards with the goal of getting rid of all of them. In order to play a card it either has to match the color, number/symbol, or be a wild card. Normal color cards with numbers don't do anything, special cards do there effects. Skips skip the next persons turn, reverses change the turn order, +2 makes the next person draw 2 cards and skips their turn, wilds let you pick the color, draw four wilds let you pick the color and make the next person draw 4 and skips their turn.  </p>
